---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Bayu Distira">
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-text mb-12">About</h1>
    
    <div class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-16 space-y-2">
      <p>Based in Indonesia</p>
      <p>Studying Informatics</p>
      <p>Interested in technology, sport, music, literature, and the universe</p>
    </div>

    <div class="font-serif italic text-2xl text-brand-accent leading-relaxed mb-20 border-l-2 border-brand-accent/30 pl-6">
      "I like understanding things by taking them apart, whether it is a piece of software, a question about the universe, or an idea I have been carrying for too long."
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-sans font-bold text-brand-text mb-8 border-b border-brand-text/10 pb-4">Currently</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-8 font-sans text-brand-text/80">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-2">Learning</h3>
        <p>Astro framework architecture.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-2">Building</h3>
        <p>My digital garden.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-2">Reading</h3>
        <p>Norwegian Wood by Haruki Murakami.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-2">Listening</h3>
        <p>Linkin Park - Something I keep returning to.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-2">Wondering about</h3>
        <p>If we are a way for the universe to know itself, what does it think of us?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
